g is used—the key light is a softbox positioned 45 degrees to the front side for even highlights, the fill light is a low-intensity reflector on the left to brighten shadows, and the rim light is a narrow-beam spotlight from the rear right to accentuate cheekbones and hair strands. Shot with an 85mm f/1.2 prime lens, the extremely shallow depth of field renders the background into a creamy bokeh of faint color blocks and light flares, ensuring zero distraction from the subject. The entire image is sharp and crystal-clear, with the texture of the periorbital skin, lash roots, and eyeliner edges rendered in stunning 4K ultra-high-definition detail, exemplifying professional high-end beauty studio photography.'},{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01tCFNKB1IgmguoHC1Z_!!6000000000923-0-tps-2688-1536.jpg",description:"A Caucasian man in his early seventies, with slightly tousled short gray-white hair and deep-set, vivid light blue eyes. His face is marked by pronounced, natural wrinkles: three deep horizontal lines across the forehead, radiating crow’s feet at the corners of the eyes, and clearly defined nasolabial folds and marionette lines flanking the mouth. His skin displays a warm, natural tone with subtle age spots, faint reddish capillaries, and short, coarse gray-black stubble. He wears a coarse-textured, beige wool turtleneck sweater, its yarn fibers distinctly visible, showing slight pilling and soft creases. Seated upright yet relaxed in a dark brown vintage leather armchair, his hands rest naturally folded on his knees. His expression is calm and reserved, his gaze turned slightly aside, conveying quiet wisdom and gentle resolve shaped by time. The background is a softly blurred, warmly lit study: extremely shallow depth of field reveals only indistinct outlines of oak bookshelves, a row of gilded book spines, and the edges of green plant leaves. Soft natural light streams diagonally through a tall window on the left, casting finely graded chiaroscuro along his right cheek and nose bridge, accentuating the texture of his skin, the direction of his wrinkles, and the three-dimensional quality of the sweater’s fibers. Rendered in ultra-high-definition photorealistic style, the image captures extreme detail: the subtle depressions of each wrinkle, the slight skin elevations at the base of stubble hairs, the precise curl and light reflection of individual wool fibers, the fine cracks and gradual sheen variations on the leather armchair, and even dust particles suspended visibly within the Tyndall-effect light beams."},{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01GAGbbu1Ip1ow3vKmv_!!6000000000941-0-tps-2688-1536.jpg",description:"Three green tree frogs perch side by side on a moss-covered rock glistening with moisture: the left frog has its eyes slightly closed and relaxed lips, its smooth-textured skin conveying calmness; the middle frog’s eyelids are half-lowered, its gaze distant and mouth straight, its body faintly shimmering with a misty sheen that suggests aloofness; the right frog’s eyes are wide open, encircled by a soft golden glow, its lips curved into a gentle smile, a pink tongue extending about 3 millimeters, limbs naturally outstretched with clearly visible toe pads, radiating joy. The rock is blanketed in thick, lush green moss, wet and reflective, dotted with tiny water droplets and minute fragments of decaying leaves. In the softly blurred background, a tropical rainforest stream winds through the scene, morning mist drifting like gauze through the mid- and far distance, layers of ferns and banana leaves overlapping, their edges and veins adorned with crystal-clear dewdrops, some slowly sliding down. A slanted ray of morning light pierces through the forest canopy, forming a soft Tyndall beam in the mist that illuminates the frogs’ backs and nearby foliage. The image exhibits a realistic style with ultra-high-definition 8K natural photography quality, precisely controlled depth of field rendering the frogs sharply crisp while the background transitions smoothly into natural bokeh. Colors are richly saturated yet true to life—emerald frogs, deep green moss, warm gray mist, translucent dewdrops, and a delicate golden halo harmoniously unified."},{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01D5BCtm1l1fzxQsLqt_!!6000000004759-0-tps-2528-1446.jpg",description:"A realistic-style summer forest scene. At the center of the composition lies a secluded, tranquil woodland clearing. Tall, upright oaks and beeches form the main canopy layer; their dense crowns appear a deep, weighty ink green, with subtle waxy highlights on the leaf surfaces. Soft yet intense sunlight filters through gaps in the canopy, forming clearly visible Tyndall beams in the air. The edges of the beams carry a slightly warm golden tone, creating a delicate contrast with the cool green shadows. In the midground, a cluster of newly sprouted maple branches spreads bright, vivid emerald-green leaves. The veins are distinct, the leaves semi-translucent, with gently curled edges, as if freshly washed by morning dew. In the left foreground, low holly and viburnum shrubs are covered in a soft, matte olive green; their interlaced branches and leaves show fine textures, with some leaf undersides reflecting a pale gray-green sheen. The ground is covered by a thick, moist layer of moss composed of multiple species: up close are plush, tassel-like mosses in a full, lustrous green, their surfaces beaded with tiny dew droplets; slightly farther away, scale moss and sphagnum intertwine, showing transitions from bluish gray-green to brownish green; beneath them, the decaying leaf litter is faintly visible, blending dark brown and deep green into an organic texture. All vegetation surfaces carry a natural, slightly damp sheen, and extremely fine suspended particles drift within the light beams. The background forest gradually softens into blur, retaining depth without competing with the main subject, while the distance merges into a thin layer of blue-green mist. The overall lighting is slanting sunlight from around 10 a.m., with moderate contrast between light and shadow. The green palette is precisely differentiated through more than 23 variations of brightness, saturation, temperature, and material qualities (such as waxy, velvety, leathery, and gelatinous), with no sense of repetition, creating a lush, breathing, detail-rich, and ecologically authentic secret summer forest."},{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01L3M9El1DWdqE9Vjxk_!!6000000000224-0-tps-2688-1536.jpg",description:'A photograph of a large, white dry-erase board with handwritten content using blue, red, green, purple, and black markers, matching the style and layout of the provided image. At the top, the title "THE RISE OF SUBAGENTS" is prominently written in large blue uppercase letters. Below it, in smaller black text, is "Based on Philschmid\'s blog post (© 2025)".\n\nThe left side has a section titled "PROBLEM: MONOLITHIC AGENT" in red. Below it, a rectangular box labeled "BIG AGENT (Monolithic)" contains hand-drawn squiggles and text like "Many Tasks", "Huge Context Window", "Too Many Tools", "CLUTTERED & LESS RELIABLE". A red arrow points to a box labeled "CONTEXT POLLUTION". Below this is a green title "SOLUTION: SUBAGENTS (Specialized)".\n\nThe center features a detailed flowchart titled "SUBAGENT ARCHITECTURE" in black. All boxes and connecting lines are drawn in blue marker, with black text inside. A top box "USER REQUEST" leads down to "ORCHESTRATOR AGENT" (with sub-points box, which has a blue underline and contains the handwritten black text: "- Analyzes Request", "- Decomposes Task", "- Delegates to Subagents"). This splits into three arrows leading into a dashed-line box labeled "ISOLATED EXECUTION (Focused Context)". Inside this dashed box are three "SUBAGENT" boxes (1, 2, n...) with their own sub-points, sub-points containing the handwritten black text: "- Own Context", "- Own Tools", "- Solves Task A/B/C". Three blue arrows emerge and converge into another "ORCHESTRATOR AGENT" box (with "Synthesizes Results"), leading down to a final "FINAL ANSWER" box.\n\nThe right side is divided into two sections. Top: blue title "EXPLICIT, USER-DEFINED SUBAGENTS", with a flow from "STATIC FILE / CODE" to "Reusable Specialists Team". A blue box contains sample code, inside the box, handwritten black text reads exactly: "--- name: \'Code-Reviewer\' description: \'MUST BE USED...\' tools: [\'file_read\', \'search_code\']. Below this are two lists. On the left, written in green marker: "PROS: Full control, Predictable, Reusable". On the right, written in red marker: "CONS: Rigid, State Management, Hard to Scale". Bottom: green title "IMPLICIT, ON-THE-FLY SUBAGENTS", with a flow from "DYNAMIC CREATION" to "Temporary, Task-Specific". A green box contains sample code, inside the box, handwritten black text shows a Python function call: "# Orchestrator calls tool send_message_to_agent( agent_name=\'q3_report...\', description=\'...\', message=\'Draft email...\') )". Below this are two lists. Written in green marker: "PROS: Flexible, No Setup, Multi-step context". Directly beneath it, written in red marker: "CONS: Less predictable, Debugging difficult".\n\nAt the bottom center, a purple title "CONCLUSION & TAKEAWAYS" introduces four bullet points written in black marker: "CONTEXT ENGINEERING IS EVERYTHING!", "Focused Environment = Better Performance, Lower Cost", "Reliability via Isolation", and "Don\'t Over-engineer!". Red and blue markers and a black eraser rest in the tray below. The whiteboard surface shows slight wear and overhead reflections.'},{sourceImageList:["https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01Uexit1206ulXCGBZv_!!6000000006801-2-tps-1328-1328.png"],src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN0192DFe51RpKclEnurK_!!6000000002160-2-tps-1328-1328.png",description:"Ultra-detailed 3D graphite pencil sketch of a person actively drawing, rendered on textured white notebook paper. The subject’s hand is holding a pencil, mid-stroke, as the sketch dynamically emerges from the page. Surrounding the drawing area: realistic pencil shavings, a pink eraser, and a metal pencil sharpener resting naturally on the paper. Emphasize high-fidelity paper texture—visible grain, subtle fibers, and minor imperfections like slight creases or soft folds. Include authentic graphite effects: soft smudges, fine residue, and nuanced tonal gradients. Cast realistic ambient shadows under objects and around the hand to enhance depth and tactile presence. Style: photorealistic hand-drawn aesthetic, monochrome graphite tones, macro-level detail."},{sourceImageList:["https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01Uexit1206ulXCGBZv_!!6000000006801-2-tps-1328-1328.png"],src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01kUdRxi1kVcH5C8ISv_!!6000000004689-2-tps-1328-1328.png",description:"Create a high-quality 3D avatar of the person in the uploaded image with a cheerful, expressive face. The character should have a warm smile, bright eyes, and soft facial features that feel friendly and approachable. Render in a Pixar-style aesthetic with smooth textures, subtle skin shading, and slightly exaggerated proportions for a cute, animated look. Lighting should be soft and even, creating a clean studio look with gentle shadows for depth."},{sourceImageList:["https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01Uexit1206ulXCGBZv_!!6000000006801-2-tps-1328-1328.png"],src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01xLPQIH1V9Qr0ExqVI_!!6000000002610-2-tps-1328-1328.png",description:"A close-up, professionally composed photograph of a hand-crocheted yarn doll gently cradled in two hands. The doll has a soft, rounded chibi form, faithfully reimagining the character from the uploaded image with vivid contrasting colors and intricate, tactile details. The hands are natural and expressive—fingers relaxed yet clearly defined, with realistic skin texture, subtle veins, and gentle light-to-shadow transitions that convey warmth and human presence. The background is softly blurred, revealing a cozy indoor setting: a warm-toned wooden tabletop bathed in diffused daylight streaming through a nearby window. The overall atmosphere is intimate, serene, and tender, celebrating both the artistry of handmade craft and the quiet affection of holding something cherished."},{sourceImageList:["https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01Uexit1206ulXCGBZv_!!6000000006801-2-tps-1328-1328.png"],src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN016vFiI81beTOMAEFwM_!!6000000003490-2-tps-1328-1328.png",description:"Create a stylized 3D chibi character based on the attached photo, faithfully preserving the subject’s distinctive facial features and key clothing details. The character strikes a playful pose—sitting on the edge of a giant Instagram-style frame with both legs dangling outside—and forms a finger heart with their left hand, topped by a glowing red heart icon. The frame’s top edge displays the username “Beauty” in clean, modern typography. Floating around the scene are subtle, semi-transparent social media UI elements: like, comment, and share icons, rendered in a cohesive, non-distracting style. The overall aesthetic is vibrant, cute, and digitally native—blending kawaii chibi charm with contemporary social media visual language."},{sourceImageList:["https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01VG3zkx1zC7eZzY97Q_!!6000000006677-2-tps-512-512.png","https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01AQ50gZ1SsMrjmaeBw_!!6000000002302-2-tps-736-736.png"],src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01Ma8xRN1xB5Wl7L2Gn_!!6000000006404-2-tps-1024-1024.png",description:"Please generate high-definition Christmas photos for my couple, ensuring accurate reproduction of facial features and identities from the uploaded images. Clothing: The girl wears a white lace slip dress with a white fluffy shawl, her long dark brown hair styled in a single side braid adorned with a small green Christmas tree ornament. The boy wears a white knitted cardigan over a white shirt and white trousers. Makeup: The girl’s makeup is light and shimmery; the boy’s is light and natural, only brightening his skin tone. Background: A green Christmas tree decorated with gold and silver ornaments, a white wall, green and white balloons, and gift boxes wrapped in green paper with silver ribbons. Pose: Expressive and natural movements. Atmosphere: Soft, bright lighting; a fresh, gentle mood; rich detail; and a film-like texture with strong grain. Style: Christmas theme in Kodak Portra 400 film style."},{sourceImageList:["https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01Uexit1206ulXCGBZv_!!6000000006801-2-tps-1328-1328.png"],src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01JfrYlp1O8KajeDs4B_!!6000000001660-2-tps-1024-1024.png",description:"Please generate a Christmas-themed studio photo of a person and pet, preserving the subject's facial features and expression while maintaining consistent proportions. The composition should be vertical, featuring a frontal, eye-level, mid-range shot leaning toward full-body framing. On the right side of the image, a woman sits on the floor wearing a dark green knitted off-the-shoulder sweater (with cutout/off-the-shoulder design), paired with a long red scarf and a green Christmas tree-shaped headband decorated with small red balls. Her makeup is fresh and natural, creating a gentle, sweet overall mood. She cradles a light brown teddy bear plush toy—wearing a red-and-green plaid knitted scarf—in her left arm, while her right index finger points upward toward decorative English text at the top of the image. To her left sits a golden retriever with fluffy, golden fur, an excited expression, tongue lolling in a happy smile, and a red bow tie around its neck. The dog tilts its head slightly back, gazing in the direction the woman is pointing, establishing an interactive connection. On the left side of the frame stands a snow-dusted white Christmas tree adorned with red, green, and gold baubles, gold star ornaments, and snowflake decorations. Neatly stacked beneath the tree are several colorful gift boxes—green boxes tied with red ribbons and red boxes with green ribbons. The background is a seamless, pure white studio setting encompassing both walls and floor. Centered at the top is a large, handwritten “Merry Christmas” in dark green calligraphy, surrounded by floating red, green, and gold confetti, stars, and snowflakes that create a festive, gently falling effect. The overall color palette emphasizes Christmas red, pine green, and gold accents, rendered with bright, high-key highlights, soft even lighting, and subtle shadows. Textures are crisp and refined, clearly showcasing hair strands and knitwear details, resulting in a clean, luminous, warm, and celebratory commercial poster aesthetic. All details are sharp and high-resolution."},{sourceImageList:["https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01xfDuPp1QDwg7NCM1l_!!6000000001943-2-tps-1600-2133.png"],src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN019msx361dXGO8i0Rh3_!!6000000003745-2-tps-896-1184.png",description:"Please ensure the animal’s facial features and species in the reference image are reproduced with 100% accuracy and no deviation. Generate a nine-grid Christmas-themed photo for me with the following requirements: Subject: Cat with a round face and big round eyes. Style: 3x3 Christmas-themed nine-grid photo, bright, cute, soothing, high-resolution adorable pet photo with soft lighting and a clean light-colored (off-white/white) background featuring soft shadows. Elements in each grid:  \n1. Cat in a Christmas tree-shaped pet bed, sticking out its tongue.  \n2. Wearing a red and green snowflake-patterned knitted scarf, head slightly tilted.  \n3. Wearing a classic plush Santa hat.  \n4. Wearing a large red bow headband, holding a gift box decorated with red ribbons.  \n5. Middle grid: Hand-drawn style “Merry Christmas” text.  \n6. Wearing a Christmas tree hat adorned with stars and a red plaid scarf.  \n7. Gingerbread man plush toy wearing a green bow tie, sticking out its tongue.  \n8. Wearing a red plush Santa hat with yellow stars, yawning (paired with a snowflake-patterned sweater).  \n9. Sitting on a red and white plaid cushion in a well-behaved posture.  \nThe image should be bright with high color saturation."},{sourceImageList:["https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01qXsgc01PWtRp4laGI_!!6000000001849-2-tps-1138-1362.png"],src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01QVEMzK1cxztKSiT76_!!6000000003668-2-tps-928-1120.png",description:"Based on the uploaded images, please create a four-panel Christmas animal photo collage, each featuring a different pose while preserving the original facial features and aiming for a realistic, natural appearance:\n\nFirst panel: The dog wears a red knitted Christmas outfit, a matching red knitted Santa hat, and a Christmas-themed knitted scarf, smiling and tilting its head.\n\nSecond panel: The dog is surrounded by Christmas elements—it lies on a white plush chair, holding a gingerbread man plush toy. The gingerbread man wears a scarf that matches the dog’s, creating a cute, coordinated look.\n\nThird panel: The dog rests relaxed on a soft plush rug or blanket, chin gently resting on its front paws, gazing at the camera with a gentle or curious expression. It wears a red Christmas knitted sweater and scarf; the hat is optional. Several small gingerbread man plush toys are arranged in front of or beside the dog—either neatly lined up or scattered—to give the impression of being surrounded by gingerbread men. The background includes soft Christmas tree lights and subtle gift box outlines, evoking a warm, playful atmosphere.\n\nFourth panel: The dog stands facing away but turns its body slightly (about 45 degrees) and looks back toward the camera with its tail held naturally upright, lightly holding a mini Christmas gift box (wrapped in red-and-green checkered paper with a gold ribbon) in its mouth. The background is a clean, solid red Christmas-themed backdrop with light, simple accents, featuring the words “MERRY CHRISTMAS” and “She has many gingerbread man toys” in English, along with minimal gingerbread man illustrations. The overall design stays true to the Christmas theme, radiating warmth and playfulness through the presence of gingerbread man toys."}],Ib={image:[{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01OOgCxP1XmTt33c9cm_!!6000000002966-0-tps-2720-1536.jpg",description:'This is a horizontally opened natural science book double-page spread, with an overall white paper background, a clear spine dividing line in the center, elegant borders of fine gold lines around the page edges, illustrations in a realistic natural history watercolor style, text mostly in black serif font, with species Latin names in italics. The left page header reads "NORTH AMERICA", and the right page header reads "BIRDS OF THE NEW WORLD". The large title at the top left of the left page reads "Birds of North America", with a small circular globe icon beside it showing North America\'s position with light blue oceans and light brownish-green continents. The small descriptive text to the right of the title reads: "From Arctic tundra to tropical shores, North America hosts over a thousand bird species. They fill the air with song, skim coasts and marshes, roam forests, and ride winds across vast distances." The center-left of the left page features a watercolor map illustration of North America in light green, beige, and blue-white topographic effects, with surrounding ocean labels "ARCTIC OCEAN", "PACIFIC OCEAN", "ATLANTIC OCEAN", and "GULF OF MEXICO", with multiple colorful dashed migration routes overlaid on the map and scattered black bird silhouettes. The lower left of the map has a small white-background legend box titled "Migration key", where green dashed lines correspond to "Spring migration", orange dashed lines to "Fall migration", blue lines to "Year-round resident", dark blue dashed lines to "Irregular / local movement", with a scale bar below reading "0 500 1000 km". The upper right area of the left page shows a full-body flight illustration of a large bald eagle, with wings widely spread, dark brown plumage with fine feather texture, clearly visible white head and tail, yellow beak and talons, with adjacent text reading "Bald eagle", "Haliaeetus leucocephalus", description "A national emblem and powerful hunter of lakes, rivers, and coasts. ", size information "Length: 70–102 cm" and "Wingspan: 180–230 cm". The lower right area of the left page has an illustration of a Northern Cardinal perched on a flowering branch, the male bird entirely bright red with a pointed crest, black mask surrounding an orange-red short beak, with green leaves and white five-petaled flowers on the branch, text reading "Northern cardinal", "Cardinalis cardinalis", description "A familiar backyard songbird with bold red plumage and a distinct crest.", size "Length: 21–23 cm". The bottom left of the left page shows a half-body watercolor illustration of a Common Loon floating on water, with black head and neck bearing a white collar and black-and-white checkerboard back feathers, striking red eyes, water surface rendered in blue-gray brushstrokes with ripples, adjacent text reading "Common loon", "Gavia immer", description "A master diver of northern lakes with a haunting call and striking black-and-white plumage.", size "Length: 58–69 cm". Spanning from the bottom of the left page to near the center fold is a thin-bordered horizontal information box titled "HABITATS ACROSS THE CONTINENT", containing five small rectangular habitat illustrations: the first showing snowy mountains and low tundra landscape, titled "Tundra", description "Short summers, long migrations."; the second showing green temperate forest with densely packed vertical trunks, titled "Temperate forest", description "Layered woods teeming with life."; the third showing golden open prairie, titled "Prairie", description "Open grasslands shaped by wind and fire."; the fourth showing wetland water surface and grass, titled "Wetlands", description "Nesting and feeding grounds for millions."; the fifth showing rocky coastline and water, titled "Coastal shores", description "Where land and sea meet—and birds thrive." The footer at the lower left of the left page shows page number "28". The upper left of the right page has an illustration of a Blue Jay perched on an oak branch, with blue, white, and black coloring, raised crest feathers, long tail feathers, oak leaves and several acorns on the branch, text reading "Blue jay", "Cyanocitta cristata", description "Intelligent and vocal, thrives in forests and suburbs. Caches acorns and aids forest regeneration.", size "Length: 25–30 cm". The upper right of the right page shows an illustration of a Wood Thrush standing on a grayish-brown branch, brown back, white belly with dark spots, mouth open in song, text reading "Wood thrush", "Hylocichla mustelina", description "A woodland songster with a flute-like voice. Favors mature forests.", size "Length: 20–23 cm". The upper center-left of the right page has a Ruby-throated Hummingbird hovering near a red flower, with a long slender beak reaching toward the corolla, rapidly vibrating wings appearing as semi-transparent gray shadows, male throat showing red metallic sheen, text reading "Ruby-throated hummingbird", "Archilochus colubris", description "A tiny aerial acrobat that defends flowers fiercely. Males flash iridescent red throats.", size "Length: 7.5–9 cm". The center-left of the right page shows a full-body illustration of a Great Blue Heron standing in shallow water among reeds, with long straight legs, layered gray-blue plumage, curved long neck, elongated yellow beak pointing right, light blue reflection and grass in the water, text reading "Great blue heron", "Ardea herodias", description "A patient hunter of wetlands, using its long neck to catch fish and amphibians.", size "Length: 100–117 cm" and "Wingspan: 167–201 cm". The center-right of the right page has a thin-lined rectangular information box titled "CONSERVATION IN ACTION", with body text "People across North America protect habitats and engage in community science. Simple actions—planting natives, reducing window strikes, keeping cats indoors—make a big difference.", with a small horizontal photo embedded on the right side showing multiple outdoor birdwatchers facing away or sideways from the camera, wearing jackets and hats, holding binoculars or cameras, facing wetlands, grassland, and distant tree lines under an overcast grayish-blue sky. The right side main subject of the right page is a large Peregrine Falcon in a diving hunting pose, wings angled open, clear gray-blue back and striped belly, prominent yellow eye rings and talons, adjacent text reading "Peregrine falcon", "Falco peregrinus", description "The fastest animal on Earth, diving over 300 km/h. ", size information "Length: 34–58 cm" and "Wingspan: 80–120 cm". The lower center of the right page shows an illustration of two Mallards swimming on the water, the male in front with metallic green head, yellow beak, white neck ring, chestnut breast and grayish-brown body, the female behind with brown mottled plumage, surrounded by reeds and blue-gray water patterns, text reading "Mallard", "Anas platyrhynchos", description "Abundant and adaptable, found on ponds, rivers, and coasts.", size "Length: 50–65 cm". The lower right of the right page shows a frontal illustration of a Great Horned Owl perched on a thick branch, brown-gray mottled plumage, distinct facial disk, yellow eyes staring forward, raised ear tufts on top, talons gripping the branch, text reading "Great horned owl", "Bubo virginianus", description "A powerful nocturnal predator with deep hoots.", size information "Length: 46–63 cm" and "Wingspan: 91–153 cm". The footer at the lower right of the right page shows page number "29".'},{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01eMX9RU1OUJdVC3qJI_!!6000000001708-0-tps-1776-2368.jpg",description:'This is a portrait A4-sized high school mathematics mock exam scanned image, with an overall realistic toner printing texture, the paper base color being a slightly warm-white quality copy paper, with very slight paper fiber texture and soft edge shadows, the layout following rigorous and standardized Chinese mainland high school educational material formatting, printed in black Songti and Heiti mixed typefaces, with mathematical formulas and letters using standard mathematical italic and upright typesetting. The left side of the page has approximately 1.5 cm binding margin blank space. Centered at the top of the page in small black text reads "绝密★启用前", below which is the bold Heiti school name "北京市第一中学", followed by an even larger and more prominent bold Heiti exam title "2024届高三年级数学模拟考试". Directly below the title is an examinee information line reading "姓名：__________  准考证号：__________  座位号：__________", with blank underlined spaces for filling in. Below the information line is a thin black solid dividing line, followed by a bold section title "一、选择题：本大题共6小题，每小题5分，共30分。在每小题给出的四个选项中，只有一项是符合题目要求的。" The multiple choice section is arranged from upper left to lower right, with bold question numbers. Question 1 reads "1. 已知集合 A = {x | x² - 3x + 2 ≤ 0}，B = {x | 1 < x < 3}，则 A ∩ B =", with four options distributed horizontally below: "A. (1, 2]" "B. [1, 2)" "C. (1, 2)" "D. [1, 2]". Question 2 reads "2. 若复数 z 满足 z(1+i) = 2i，则 z 的虚部为", with options "A. 1" "B. -1" "C. i" "D. -i". Question 3 reads "3. 已知向量 a = (1, 2)，b = (x, -1)，若 a ⊥ b，则 x =", with options "A. -2" "B. -1/2" "C. 1/2" "D. 2". Question 4 reads "4. 函数 f(x) = ln(x² - 2x) 的单调递增区间是", with options "A. (-∞, 0)" "B. (0, 1)" "C. (1, 2)" "D. (2, +∞)". Question 5 reads "5. 某学校有高一学生400人，高二学生300人，高三学生300人。现用分层抽样的方法抽取一个容量为50的样本，则高二学生应抽取的人数为", with options "A. 10" "B. 15" "C. 20" "D. 25". Question 6 reads "6. 在等差数列 {aₙ} 中，若 a₃ + a₇ = 10，则 a₅ =", with options "A. 2" "B. 5" "C. 8" "D. 10". Below the multiple choice section is a bold section title "二、填空题：本大题共4小题，每小题5分，共20分。" Fill-in-the-blank questions are arranged vertically, each ending with an underline for writing answers. Question 7 reads "7. 计算：sin 15° cos 15° = __________.". Question 8 reads "8. 若二项式 (x - 2/x)⁶ 展开式中的常数项为 __________.". Question 9 reads "9. 已知双曲线 x²/a² - y²/b² = 1 (a>0, b>0) 的一条渐近线方程为 y = √3 x，则该双曲线的离心率为 __________.". Question 10 reads "10. 曲线 y = x e^x 在点 (0, 0) 处的切线方程为 __________.". Below the fill-in-the-blank section is a bold section title "三、解答题：本大题共3小题，共50分。解答应写出文字说明、证明过程或演算步骤。" Question 11 reads "11. （本小题满分15分）在 △ABC 中，内角 A, B, C 的对边分别为 a, b, c，已知 a cos C + c cos A = (√3/2) b。（1）求角 B 的大小；（2）若 b = 2，求 △ABC 面积的最大值。" Question 12 reads "12. （本小题满分17分）已知抛物线 C: y² = 2px (p > 0) 的焦点为 F，点 M(2, y₀) 在抛物线 C 上，且 |MF| = 3。（1）求抛物线 C 的方程；（2）过点 F 的直线 l 交抛物线 C 于 A, B 两点，若 OA · OB = -3（O 为坐标原点），求直线 l 的方程。" On the right side blank area of question 12, there is a clear analytic geometry illustration containing a standard Cartesian coordinate system with arrows at the ends of the x-axis and y-axis, origin labeled "O", a smooth black parabola opening to the right drawn in the first and fourth quadrants, the focus position marked with a small black dot and the letter "F", points "A" and "B" marked on the parabola, with a line l drawn through point F connecting A and B, with the caption "图1" printed directly below the illustration. Question 13 reads "13. （本小题满分18分）如图，在四棱锥 P-ABCD 中，底面 ABCD 是矩形，平面 PAD ⊥ 平面 ABCD，△PAD 是边长为2的等边三角形，AB = 2√2，E 为 PC 的中点。（1）求证：PA ∥ 平面 BDE；（2）求二面角 E-BD-C 的余弦值。" On the right side of question 13 there is a three-dimensional geometry illustration, the base is a parallelogram representing rectangle ABCD, vertices labeled counterclockwise as "A" "B" "C" "D", with a vertex "P" above, connected by solid lines PA, PB, PC, PD, the midpoint of line segment PC labeled "E", with BE and DE connected, the obscured back half of base edge AD shown with dashed lines, with the caption "图2" printed directly below the illustration. The bottom of the page has a large standardized answer area with several light gray horizontal lines for writing. At the very bottom center of the page is the footer text "高三数学模拟试卷 第 1 页（共 4 页）". The overall layout has no text-image overlap, clear formulas, consecutive question numbers, presenting a highly professional and realistic high school mathematics exam visual effect.'},{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01s8sY1Z20qiPDSsNlN_!!6000000006901-0-tps-2720-1536.jpg",description:'This is an ultra-wide esports tournament venue photograph, set in a dark theater environment, with a black ceiling densely packed with stage lighting rigs, circular downlights, and a row of purple-blue LED spotlights arranged in an arc above the main stage, projecting cool-toned light spots toward the audience seating and the giant screen. The left side shows the audience area, with many young spectators sitting in dim blue-purple light, some holding glowing cheering sticks or raising phones to take photos, their faces illuminated by screen reflections; at the front left is a black award podium with a golden trophy on top, the trophy in a metal design with two wings spread open, with the event logo "GLORIWILD 2025" on the front of the base. The large vertical stage backdrop on the left has a deep black matte texture, with a sharp silver-gray wolf head and number 7 combined logo in the center, below which in large metallic font reads "GLORIWILD", underneath "2025" and a V-shaped mark, further below "WORLD SERIES" and "CHENGDU", with the Chinese slogan "竞无止境，荣耀为峰" at the bottom and English subtitle "BEYOND LIMITS, FOR GLORY"; at the bottom of the backdrop are three sponsor logos and text "幻界科技 HuanJie Tech", "星云电竞 NEBULA ESPORTS", "猎光显示 LIEGUANG DISPLAY", all in light gray-white, arranged on the dark background. The center of the frame, occupying the largest area, is a horizontal ultra-large competition screen with a black outer frame, displaying real-time combat from an open-world fantasy action game, with blue sky, white clouds, and canyon mountains forming the background, a bird-like anthropomorphic player character in the foreground grassland facing away from viewers, wearing a light-colored cloak and backpack, holding a round shield in the left hand and a blue longsword in the right hand, confronting a massive bull-horned monster; the monster has rough gray-black skin, curved horns, glowing red eyes, body wrapped in purple lightning and flying debris effects, rendered in a vivid 3D realistic game style. The upper left of the game interface shows multiple rows of red heart health points and a few dark hearts, with a yellow camera icon, shield and weapon linear HUD icons nearby; the top center has compass text "W", "NW", "N", "NE", with the enemy health bar labeled in white Chinese characters "黑髮西诺克斯" above it. The upper right corner of the screen shows a semi-transparent dark blue quest card with yellow vertical line highlight, with the title "击败黑髮西诺克斯", quest entry again reading "击败黑髮西诺克斯", a small hint on the right reading "查看冒险笔记", with a circular minus button icon beside it. The lower left corner of the screen shows a player info card in a black-blue diagonal-cut rectangle, displaying the large number "1", with the player name "追风少年" and English name "ZHUI FENG" beside it; the bottom center of the screen shows gamepad button prompts, reading "X 攻击", "B 冲刺", "ZL 防御", "A 跳跃" in sequence. The lower right corner has a circular minimap, a dark brown semi-transparent map with blue paths and a white triangular pointer, showing time "11:35 AM" nearby, with a sun and weather style small circular icon below. Below the main screen, the front edge of the stage features large silver-gray event text "GLORIWILD", below which reads "WORLD SERIES 2025", the whole appearing like metallic relief mounted on the black stage structure, with blue-purple illuminated lines. The right side of the frame shows the player seating area, with a young East Asian male player sitting in a black gaming chair, wearing a black team uniform or jacket, with short black hair, a focused expression, operating the monitor on the desk; his blue-purple player station has a large "1" in front, with "追风少年" and "ZHUI FENG" written behind it, the desk holding a monitor, camera, and small devices. The right vertical main backdrop is also deep black, with "GLORIWILD 7 WORLD SERIES 2025" at the top, large text in the middle reading "全球总决赛", "SINGLE RACE", "单人竞速赛", with three sponsor logos and text arranged vertically below: "幻界科技 HuanJie Tech", "星云电竞 NEBULA ESPORTS", "猎光显示 LIEGUANG DISPLAY". At the far right edge is an auxiliary vertical screen partially cropped by the frame, showing only partial tournament footage and leaderboard information, with visible text fragments including "X1…", "ZH…", "飞 F…" and time-style numbers "08:24.31". The entire scene is dominated by black, deep blue, and purple tones, with stage lighting, illuminated lines, the giant screen game footage, and audience glow sticks together creating an immersive atmosphere of a major esports grand finals.'},{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01C6ck1Z1hfkDdks4sN_!!6000000004305-0-tps-1776-2368.jpg",description:'The image is a smartphone application interface display on a white background, with the main subject being a black-framed iPhone-shaped device, with a rounded earpiece area at the top and a black capsule-shaped Dynamic Island, rounded screen corners, metallic highlight on the device edges, and a thin black gesture bar at the bottom. The top status bar shows time "9:41" on the left, with cellular signal, Wi‑Fi, and battery icons on the right. The app homepage has a black bird silhouette logo at the top left, with the brand name "羽迹 BIRDIO" in black text beside it, and a linear chat bubble icon and a four-corner expand-style scan or fullscreen icon on the right. Below is a horizontal rounded search bar, with a light gray magnifying glass icon on the left, input placeholder text "搜索商品、品牌、型号", connected to a teal-green rounded button on the right with button text "搜索". Below the search bar is a large light teal gradient promotional banner card with pronounced rounded corners, a soft light band and glassy gradient background; the left side has a white small tag "新品上市", the main title reads "羽迹 S20", with a outlined small badge "Pro" immediately to the right, subtitle "轻盈出色，自在掌控", price text "￥4999 起", with a teal-green rounded button "立即购买" below. The right side of the banner displays two light teal phone product renders, one showing the back with a triple camera module, the other standing upright showing a light-colored curved screen, with carousel indicator dots at the bottom center, the current dot in teal-green and the rest in light gray. Below the banner is a white rounded feature entry card with slight shadow, arranged left to right with five teal-green flat icons: a burst badge icon with "NEW" text corresponding to "新品发布", a trophy icon for "热卖榜", a shield-checkmark icon for "官方保障", a tag icon for "会员中心", and a gift box icon for "限时优惠". Further down is a product recommendation section, with the left title "今日推荐" and a light gray link "更多推荐 >" on the right. The recommendation area contains four horizontally arranged white rounded product cards, all with slight shadows and a shopping cart linear icon at the bottom: the first shows a dark gray phone front and back, product name "羽迹 S20", price "￥3499 起", yellow star rating "4.8"; the second shows a light teal earphone charging case and white in-ear earphones, product name "羽迹 Air 2", price "￥399", yellow star rating "4.7"; the third shows a dark green strap smartwatch with "10" and "08" visible on the watch face, product name "羽迹 Watch 3", price "￥999", yellow star rating "4.6"; the fourth shows a white power bank, product name displayed in two lines as "羽迹 10000mAh" and "充电宝", price "￥129", yellow star rating "4.8". Below is a bestseller section with the title "热卖榜" and link "更多榜单 >" on the right. The chart contains three horizontal white rounded cards: the first has a gold ranking corner badge "1", showing a light teal phone image, text "羽迹 S20 Pro" "￥4999 起", yellow star rating "4.9"; the second has a gray ranking corner badge "2", showing an earphone image, text "羽迹 Air 2" "￥399", yellow star rating "4.7"; the third has an orange ranking corner badge "3", showing a dark green smartwatch image with "10" and "08" also visible on the watch face, text "羽迹 Watch 3" "￥999", yellow star rating "4.6". Below the chart is a category tab bar, with a white rounded container containing from left to right "手机" "耳机" "手表" "充电配件" and light gray "更多分类 >", where "手机" is highlighted in teal-green with an underline indicator. The category content area displays two phone products in a horizontal list: the left product has a small phone front image, title "羽迹 S20", specs "6.67 英寸 | 骁龙 8 Gen3", price "￥3499 起", with an outlined rounded button "加入购物车" on the right; the right product has a light teal phone back and side image, title "羽迹 S20 Pro", specs "6.67 英寸 | 骁龙 8 Gen3", price "￥4999 起", also with a teal-green outlined button "加入购物车". The bottom fixed navigation bar has a white background, with four icons from left to right: house, nine-grid, shopping cart, and user avatar outline, corresponding to text "首页" "分类" "购物车" "我的", where the "首页" icon and text are highlighted in teal-green, and the rest are dark gray linear icons. The overall interface uses white and light teal-green as primary colors, combining rounded cards, soft shadows, realistic product renders, and flat linear icons to present a clean visual style of a tech e-commerce homepage.'},{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01n0HaGc1v3dtBKVS2N_!!6000000006117-0-tps-452-800.jpg",description:'This is a black-and-white grayscale manga-style fantasy adventure storyboard page, the entire page divided into multiple panels by thick black outer frames and white gutters, with dense line art, strong light-dark contrast, featuring Japanese shōnen manga speed lines, burst lines, and onomatopoeia. The topmost panel is a horizontal ultra-wide long shot, spanning approximately the full page width, showing a small anthropomorphic owl standing with its back to the viewer on a broken stone bridge, small and round in stature, with head feathers sticking up, wearing thick black-framed glasses, a light-colored hoodie, shorts, and sneakers, carrying a dark backpack, looking toward a distant towering fantasy spired castle. Surrounding it are broken archways, ruined stone pillars, weeds, and floating leaves, with massive swirling cloud layers in the sky and bridges, platforms, and ruin structures around the distant castle. In an irregular speech bubble at the upper left reads "风之塔 就在前面了……", in black Chinese text with hand-drawn angular bubble edges. The second row left panel is a medium close-up, with a black-cloaked hooded figure occupying the center-right of the frame, face hidden by shadow with only sharp glowing eye outlines visible, both hands holding a complex circular mechanical energy core with concentric circles, rune-like engravings, and layered metallic structure, with white lightning and fractured light rays bursting from around it, onomatopoeia "滋滋" at the lower left and near the core, speech bubble reading "只差一步！ 风之塔的力量， 就是我的了！". The second row right panel is a strongly perspective-driven horizontal action scene, the small owl running forward on an ancient stone corridor bridge or elevated walkway, arms spread wide, hoodie and backpack swaying with movement, background architecture lines rapidly extending backward creating a sense of speed, upper left speech bubble reading "到此为止！". The third row left panel is a close-up of the owl\'s face, black-framed glasses occupying the main visual center, round eyes wide open, gaze determined, feathers and beak rendered with fine cross-hatching, left speech bubble reading "把它 交出来！". The third row right panel is a medium close-up of the cloaked figure, black cape billowing in the energy blast, both hands still gripping the circular mechanical core, the core shooting radial white light and debris lines outward, the figure\'s expression hidden under the hood shadow, left speech bubble reading "哼！ 你拦不住 我！". The fourth row consists of three consecutive action panels: in the left panel the owl dodges forward from the lower left, the cloaked figure lunges or swings from behind, the circular core flies out between them, the background filled with diagonal speed lines, debris, and explosion light points, with large onomatopoeia "闪！" on the left side and tilted bold black onomatopoeia "砰！" at the lower right. In the narrow middle panel the owl leaps upward from crumbling ground, both wings and arms spread outward, body thrusting forward, background filled with radial speed lines, impact debris at the bottom, exaggerated onomatopoeia "跃！" at the lower center. In the right panel the owl closes in on the cloaked figure, both hands wrestling with the opponent over the glowing circular core, the core positioned at the center-right of the frame, with blinding white light and radial lines bursting around it, cloaks, feathers, and arms overlapping in intense close-quarters conflict, with large tilted onomatopoeia "砰！" at the upper right. The fifth row is a horizontal wide resolution panel, the small owl standing on the left side of a ruin edge, in a side profile pose holding the captured circular mechanical core in both hands, eyes behind glasses calm and focused, in the distant background the Wind Tower shoots a bright beam of light from its peak, with rotating energy rings and arc lightning above, ruins, grass, clouds, and floating leaves extending into the far distance, center speech bubble reading "结束了……". The bottommost panel is a horizontal ultra-wide finale long shot, the small owl again standing with its back to the viewer on a high broken cliff stone platform, backpack, hoodie, shorts, sneakers, and upright head feathers clearly visible, standing on broken stone bricks, with a vast valley, winding roads, rivers, ruin clusters, distant mountains, and a central tower spreading before it, bright open sky with white clouds, flying birds, and scattered leaves, an oval speech bubble on the right reading "新的旅程， 开始了。", the overall narrative progressing from reaching the Wind Tower, reclaiming the energy core, to gazing at the new journey, presenting an epic fantasy adventure manga page effect.'},{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01pFX9nd1ZSRnH8j5wX_!!6000000003193-0-tps-2720-1536.jpg",description:"This is a female close-up portrait photography work full of vintage film texture. The main subject is a young Asian woman, captured by the lens in an extreme close-up framing of her face. She has dark brown slightly curly layered hair, with several seemingly slightly damp or styled strands casually falling across her forehead, cheeks, and in front of her eyes, some strands glowing with golden highlights under the light. Her face shape is rounded and delicate, with naturally straight eyebrows, deep brown eyes gazing directly into the camera, her gaze deep with a hint of dreaminess and languidness, double eyelids clearly visible. Her eyes are done with warm orange-pink toned eyeshadow, with lashes distinctly defined one by one. Her nose bridge is straight, lips full and slightly parted, faintly revealing a bit of white teeth, with a moistly glossy high-saturation bright orange-red lip glaze applied on her lips. Her left ear is partially visible, with multiple delicate small silver and gold studs and small hoop earrings on the ear. She is wearing a dark-based garment with an elaborate mixed print pattern of red, orange, and white. The light and shadow composition of the image is extremely artistic. A strong warm-toned direct light hits her face from the left side of the frame, creating an atmosphere as if bathed in the golden hour of dusk. Most strikingly, the light passes through plants, casting clear dark brown flower and leaf silhouette shadows on her nose bridge, left cheek, and chin area, creating a dappled and dramatically theatrical light spot effect. The foreground and spatial layers are cleverly constructed. The upper right corner has a large out-of-focus orange-pink flower as a foreground bokeh overlay, and at the right edge a hand is faintly visible holding a fresh flower with pink petals and green stems, near her eye corner. The left side and lower half of the frame have several slender, twisting dried dark branches and sporadically dotted small white flowers, these plant elements distributed both in and out of focus, adding depth and layering. The background presents a soft out-of-focus grayish-blue tone, forming a strong warm-cool color contrast with the warm-toned light and shadow on the subject's face. The entire image has noticeable noise and grain, rich saturated colors, overall presenting a strong vintage film photography style and a romantic, dreamy aesthetic atmosphere."},{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN018YoUdp1F3RrORk0GC_!!6000000000431-0-tps-2720-1536.jpg",description:"This is a portrait close-up photograph with film photography texture, primarily documenting a young Asian male standing outdoors. The image uses a medium shot composition with strong light-shadow contrast. On the left side of the frame is a lush plant with branches winding upward. The plant is covered with deep green oval leaves, some leaves showing a slight sheen under the light, with clusters of small red berries and a few scattered small white flowers dotted among the branches. Moving to the center of the frame, a young Asian male stands. He has side-parted black short hair with a slightly damp, styled look. His face is lean with a clear jawline, a prominent Adam's apple, wearing a pair of thin-framed round metal glasses, with a calm and slightly melancholic expression, gazing directly into the camera. He wears a light grayish-white short-sleeved Cuban collar shirt, the material appearing to be cotton-linen, lightweight in texture and loose in fit. For his lower half, he wears a pair of khaki linen trousers, the trouser surface showing the natural wrinkle texture characteristic of linen material, with a thin long fabric tie string hanging from the waist. His arms are naturally drawn back behind him, beyond the frame edges. Directly behind the man is a glass door with white wooden or metal frames, the glass surface showing a light green reflection, faintly reflecting the building outlines across the way. On the right side immediately adjacent to the glass door is a brick-and-stone wall coated in white paint, the wall surface rough, retaining the horizontal bumpy texture of brick joints, with a vertical crack winding from top to bottom on the right side. The entire scene is bathed in strong sunlight, the sunlight filtering through gaps in the trees, casting large areas of deep and dappled tree shadows on the man's cheeks, neck, light-colored shirt, linen trousers, and the brick wall on the right. These scattered light spots and high-contrast shadows interweave together, adding a rich summer afternoon atmosphere and a quiet, artistic ambiance to the image."},{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01HqEABM1DFEp9QndaK_!!6000000000186-0-tps-2720-1536.jpg",description:"The image is a horizontally composed Suzhou embroidery piece, entirely laid out on a light beige linen background, with clearly visible fine warp and weft weaving texture, presenting a soft, natural, handcraft-feel matte quality. The main subject is a small songbird, occupying most of the area from the center to the right side of the frame, with its body extending horizontally, head facing left, and tail feathers extending to the lower right corner. The bird's outline is plump and rounded, rendered in highly realistic Suzhou embroidery needlework, with feathers meticulously embroidered using extremely fine split-silk genuine silk threads (which can be split down to single-strand level)—every single silk strand is distinctly visible and exquisitely detailed, emitting a lustrous yet restrained silk sheen under even soft light, the sheen not a uniform brightness but rather producing subtle light-dark variations according to stitch direction, arrangement density, and silk twist, as if light is gliding over countless tiny mirrors; the colors are primarily cream-white, light brown, gray-brown, olive green, and dark yellow-green, achieving delicate transitions through multi-layered overlay embroidery, while always maintaining the inherent transparency and sharp edges of the silk threads, absolutely free of the murky, fluffy, or matte felt quality of wool yarn. The bird's head is positioned in the upper-left area of the frame, with a slender sharp beak, the dark brown upper beak forming a clear contrast with the lighter lower edge; the eye is black and circular with a highlight, surrounded by fine single-strand-level silk thread outlining a light eyebrow stripe and dark eye line, the lines as sharp as gongbi painting, making the face appear delicate and spirited. The bird's chest and belly are in the center of the frame, in a fluffy light cream-white color, with dense stitching showing subtle slight elevation, the stitch direction following the body's arc downward, creating the layered effect of soft down feathers—yet all silk threads remain flat and smooth, each individual stitch clearly discernible, the sheen flowing along the arc, like real feathers naturally reflecting light, rather than relying on thread thickness to build volume. The back and wings cover the center-right portion of the frame, with flight feathers neatly arranged, dark brown, black, golden-brown, and olive-yellow high-sheen genuine silk threads precisely interlaced, edges outlined with light-colored silk thread creating feather margins, forming fine and sharp stripe-like structures; upon close examination, each flight feather is composed of dozens of individual silk threads arranged in parallel, thread by thread, parallel and non-adhering, their sheen flickering with subtle shifts in viewing angle. The tail feathers extend from the right side toward the lower right corner, narrow and pointed, transitioning in color from olive-yellow to gray-brown, with clearly delineated parallel straight-stitch silk threads as precise as drawn lines, the stitching so fine as to approach hair-thin diameter, each thread carrying its own independent reflection, together composing the visually rhythmic quality of lightweight, directional feathers. The bird's two thin legs are positioned below, precisely embroidered with dark brown genuine silk thread showing slender joints, with claws gripping a horizontal branch, the claw sections formed by tightly wound extremely fine silk threads layered in coils, creating clear yet restrained three-dimensional elevation, with a tactile quality resembling real bird claws, yet still maintaining the smooth, sharp contour and point highlights characteristic of silk thread. The left side of the frame has a group of diagonally extending plant branches and leaves, stretching from the lower left toward the center, with brown branches showing woody grain texture through twisted silk and wrapped stitching techniques, surrounded by light green, gray-green, and cream-yellow leaves and soft flower-spike structures; these leaves are elliptical or lanceolate, their surfaces composed of dense short stitches using 1/8 to 1/16 strand split genuine silk thread, edges with staggered short stitches simulating natural fuzzy edges, delicate without being scraggly, each short thread reflecting light independently, creating a soft yet distinct leaf surface texture. The right side and upper right of the frame have additional groups of plant branches, stems extending in from the right edge, adorned with small light green leaves and pale yellow-white spike-shaped flower clusters, likewise embroidered with hair-thin genuine silk thread, the spike granules defined by one to two independent silk thread stitches, each granule distinct, the sheen clear and translucent, framing the main bird subject naturally. The overall color palette is low-saturation, warm, and elegantly understated, with even, soft lighting and no strong shadows, yet producing rich visual layers due to the high sheen and physical independence of the silk threads. Every stitch is clearly sharp, the silk threads do not merge into one but exist as individual \"strands\"—adjacent yet unblended, each reflecting light independently, together constructing the three-dimensional vitality of feathers, branches, leaves, and flower spikes. This strand-by-strand, thread-by-thread luminous genuine silk texture creates an exquisite contrast with the matte coarseness of the linen background, highlighting Suzhou embroidery's ultimate artistry of \"shaping with thread, animating with light.\" The entire work emphasizes the fineness, smoothness, independent reflectivity, and optical activity of genuine silk fibers, with all details originating from hand-split silk and precision needle arrangement, an effect absolutely impossible to replicate with coarse thread, cotton thread, wool yarn, or digital printing. The image theme leans toward natural birds and botanical decoration, suitable for showcasing handmade Suzhou embroidery works, natural illustrations, textile patterns, or decorative art materials."}],webSearch:[{query:"Best pizza places near me"},{query:"How to fix a leaky faucet"},{query:"Cheap flights to New York"},{query:"Yoga for beginners at home"},{query:"Quick healthy dinner recipes"},{query:"Top-rated movies this year"},{query:"Learn Spanish online for free"},{query:"DIY home decor ideas"},{query:"Best budget laptops"},{query:"Cute dog names suggestions"}],guidance:{imageGeneration:[{imageUrl:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01NdWLo81xvnvVAFPLO_!!6000000006506-0-tps-2688-1536.jpg",prompt:'Close-up of a fair-skinned Western woman with blonde hair and blue eyes, focusing on the eye area. Her skin displays a natural glow and clearly visible, fine pore texture without excessive retouching. The makeup is meticulously executed: the upper eyelid features a precise, fluid line drawn with a matte black liquid eyeliner, subtly upturned 15 degrees at the outer corner; the lower waterline is delicately filled in with deep gray-brown to enhance depth; lashes are dense, long, and distinctly separated with a natural curl, showing no obvious signs of false lashes; eyebrows are full "feathered" brows with defined hair strokes and soft edges, perfectly matching her hair color. Cinematic three-point lighting is used—the key light is a softbox positioned 45 degrees to the front side for even highlights, the fill light is a low-intensity reflector on the left to brighten shadows, and the rim light is a narrow-beam spotlight from the rear right to accentuate cheekbones and hair strands. Shot with an 85mm f/1.2 prime lens, the extremely shallow depth of field renders the background into a creamy bokeh of faint color blocks and light flares, ensuring zero distraction from the subject. The entire image is sharp and crystal-clear, with the texture of the periorbital skin, lash roots, and eyeliner edges rendered in stunning 4K ultra-high-definition detail, exemplifying professional high-end beauty studio photography.'},{imageUrl:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01tCFNKB1IgmguoHC1Z_!!6000000000923-0-tps-2688-1536.jpg",prompt:"A Caucasian man in his early seventies, with slightly tousled short gray-white hair and deep-set, vivid light blue eyes. His face is marked by pronounced, natural wrinkles: three deep horizontal lines across the forehead, radiating crow’s feet at the corners of the eyes, and clearly defined nasolabial folds and marionette lines flanking the mouth. His skin displays a warm, natural tone with subtle age spots, faint reddish capillaries, and short, coarse gray-black stubble. He wears a coarse-textured, beige wool turtleneck sweater, its yarn fibers distinctly visible, showing slight pilling and soft creases. Seated upright yet relaxed in a dark brown vintage leather armchair, his hands rest naturally folded on his knees. His expression is calm and reserved, his gaze turned slightly aside, conveying quiet wisdom and gentle resolve shaped by time. The background is a softly blurred, warmly lit study: extremely shallow depth of field reveals only indistinct outlines of oak bookshelves, a row of gilded book spines, and the edges of green plant leaves. Soft natural light streams diagonally through a tall window on the left, casting finely graded chiaroscuro along his right cheek and nose bridge, accentuating the texture of his skin, the direction of his wrinkles, and the three-dimensional quality of the sweater’s fibers. Rendered in ultra-high-definition photorealistic style, the image captures extreme detail: the subtle depressions of each wrinkle, the slight skin elevations at the base of stubble hairs, the precise curl and light reflection of individual wool fibers, the fine cracks and gradual sheen variations on the leather armchair, and even dust particles suspended visibly within the Tyndall-effect light beams."},{imageUrl:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01GAGbbu1Ip1ow3vKmv_!!6000000000941-0-tps-2688-1536.jpg",prompt:"Three green tree frogs perch side by side on a moss-covered rock glistening with moisture: the left frog has its eyes slightly closed and relaxed lips, its smooth-textured skin conveying calmness; the middle frog’s eyelids are half-lowered, its gaze distant and mouth straight, its body faintly shimmering with a misty sheen that suggests aloofness; the right frog’s eyes are wide open, encircled by a soft golden glow, its lips curved into a gentle smile, a pink tongue extending about 3 millimeters, limbs naturally outstretched with clearly visible toe pads, radiating joy. The rock is blanketed in thick, lush green moss, wet and reflective, dotted with tiny water droplets and minute fragments of decaying leaves. In the softly blurred background, a tropical rainforest stream winds through the scene, morning mist drifting like gauze through the mid- and far distance, layers of ferns and banana leaves overlapping, their edges and veins adorned with crystal-clear dewdrops, some slowly sliding down. A slanted ray of morning light pierces through the forest canopy, forming a soft Tyndall beam in the mist that illuminates the frogs’ backs and nearby foliage. The image exhibits a realistic style with ultra-high-definition 8K natural photography quality, precisely controlled depth of field rendering the frogs sharply crisp while the background transitions smoothly into natural bokeh. Colors are richly saturated yet true to life—emerald frogs, deep green moss, warm gray mist, translucent dewdrops, and a delicate golden halo harmoniously unified."},{imageUrl:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01D5BCtm1l1fzxQsLqt_!!6000000004759-0-tps-2528-1446.jpg",prompt:"A realistic-style summer forest scene. At the center of the composition lies a secluded, tranquil woodland clearing. Tall, upright oaks and beeches form the main canopy layer; their dense crowns appear a deep, weighty ink green, with subtle waxy highlights on the leaf surfaces. Soft yet intense sunlight filters through gaps in the canopy, forming clearly visible Tyndall beams in the air. The edges of the beams carry a slightly warm golden tone, creating a delicate contrast with the cool green shadows. In the midground, a cluster of newly sprouted maple branches spreads bright, vivid emerald-green leaves. The veins are distinct, the leaves semi-translucent, with gently curled edges, as if freshly washed by morning dew. In the left foreground, low holly and viburnum shrubs are covered in a soft, matte olive green; their interlaced branches and leaves show fine textures, with some leaf undersides reflecting a pale gray-green sheen. The ground is covered by a thick, moist layer of moss composed of multiple species: up close are plush, tassel-like mosses in a full, lustrous green, their surfaces beaded with tiny dew droplets; slightly farther away, scale moss and sphagnum intertwine, showing transitions from bluish gray-green to brownish green; beneath them, the decaying leaf litter is faintly visible, blending dark brown and deep green into an organic texture. All vegetation surfaces carry a natural, slightly damp sheen, and extremely fine suspended particles drift within the light beams. The background forest gradually softens into blur, retaining depth without competing with the main subject, while the distance merges into a thin layer of blue-green mist. The overall lighting is slanting sunlight from around 10 a.m., with moderate contrast between light and shadow. The green palette is precisely differentiated through more than 23 variations of brightness, saturation, temperature, and material qualities (such as waxy, velvety, leathery, and gelatinous), with no sense of repetition, creating a lush, breathing, detail-rich, and ecologically authentic secret summer forest."},{imageUrl:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01L3M9El1DWdqE9Vjxk_!!6000000000224-0-tps-2688-1536.jpg",prompt:'A photograph of a large, white dry-erase board with handwritten content using blue, red, green, purple, and black markers, matching the style and layout of the provided image. At the top, the title "THE RISE OF SUBAGENTS" is prominently written in large blue uppercase letters. Below it, in smaller black text, is "Based on Philschmid\'s blog post (© 2025)".\n\nThe left side has a section titled "PROBLEM: MONOLITHIC AGENT" in red. Below it, a rectangular box labeled "BIG AGENT (Monolithic)" contains hand-drawn squiggles and text like "Many Tasks", "Huge Context Window", "Too Many Tools", "CLUTTERED & LESS RELIABLE". A red arrow points to a box labeled "CONTEXT POLLUTION". Below this is a green title "SOLUTION: SUBAGENTS (Specialized)".\n\nThe center features a detailed flowchart titled "SUBAGENT ARCHITECTURE" in black. All boxes and connecting lines are drawn in blue marker, with black text inside. A top box "USER REQUEST" leads down to "ORCHESTRATOR AGENT" (with sub-points box, which has a blue underline and contains the handwritten black text: "- Analyzes Request", "- Decomposes Task", "- Delegates to Subagents"). This splits into three arrows leading into a dashed-line box labeled "ISOLATED EXECUTION (Focused Context)". Inside this dashed box are three "SUBAGENT" boxes (1, 2, n...) with their own sub-points, sub-points containing the handwritten black text: "- Own Context", "- Own Tools", "- Solves Task A/B/C". Three blue arrows emerge and converge into another "ORCHESTRATOR AGENT" box (with "Synthesizes Results"), leading down to a final "FINAL ANSWER" box.\n\nThe right side is divided into two sections. Top: blue title "EXPLICIT, USER-DEFINED SUBAGENTS", with a flow from "STATIC FILE / CODE" to "Reusable Specialists Team". A blue box contains sample code, inside the box, handwritten black text reads exactly: "--- name: \'Code-Reviewer\' description: \'MUST BE USED...\' tools: [\'file_read\', \'search_code\']. Below this are two lists. On the left, written in green marker: "PROS: Full control, Predictable, Reusable". On the right, written in red marker: "CONS: Rigid, State Management, Hard to Scale". Bottom: green title "IMPLICIT, ON-THE-FLY SUBAGENTS", with a flow from "DYNAMIC CREATION" to "Temporary, Task-Specific". A green box contains sample code, inside the box, handwritten black text shows a Python function call: "# Orchestrator calls tool send_message_to_agent( agent_name=\'q3_report...\', description=\'...\', message=\'Draft email...\') )". Below this are two lists. Written in green marker: "PROS: Flexible, No Setup, Multi-step context". Directly beneath it, written in red marker: "CONS: Less predictable, Debugging difficult".\n\nAt the bottom center, a purple title "CONCLUSION & TAKEAWAYS" introduces four bullet points written in black marker: "CONTEXT ENGINEERING IS EVERYTHING!", "Focused Environment = Better Performance, Lower Cost", "Reliability via Isolation", and "Don\'t Over-engineer!". Red and blue markers and a black eraser rest in the tray below. The whiteboard surface shows slight wear and overhead reflections.'}],imageEdit:[{originImageUrl:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01D1as1J1L65nt2fHdQ_!!6000000001249-2-tps-1328-1328.png",prompt:"Ultra-detailed 3D graphite pencil sketch of a person actively drawing, rendered on textured white notebook paper. The subject’s hand is holding a pencil, mid-stroke, as the sketch dynamically emerges from the page. Surrounding the drawing area: realistic pencil shavings, a pink eraser, and a metal pencil sharpener resting naturally on the paper. Emphasize high-fidelity paper texture—visible grain, subtle fibers, and minor imperfections like slight creases or soft folds. Include authentic graphite effects: soft smudges, fine residue, and nuanced tonal gradients. Cast realistic ambient shadows under objects and around the hand to enhance depth and tactile presence. Style: photorealistic hand-drawn aesthetic, monochrome graphite tones, macro-level detail.",ratio:"1:1",newImageUrl:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01Zz1Vkw1wqThW3tPiv_!!6000000006359-2-tps-1328-1328.png"},{originImageUrl:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01D1as1J1L65nt2fHdQ_!!6000000001249-2-tps-1328-1328.png",prompt:"A close-up, professionally composed photograph of a hand-crocheted yarn doll gently cradled in two hands. The doll has a soft, rounded chibi form, faithfully reimagining the character from the uploaded image with vivid contrasting colors and intricate, tactile details. The hands are natural and expressive—fingers relaxed yet clearly defined, with realistic skin texture, subtle veins, and gentle light-to-shadow transitions that convey warmth and human presence. The background is softly blurred, revealing a cozy indoor setting: a warm-toned wooden tabletop bathed in diffused daylight streaming through a nearby window. The overall atmosphere is intimate, serene, and tender, celebrating both the artistry of handmade craft and the quiet affection of holding something cherished.",ratio:"1:1",newImageUrl:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01934VZ31nXr3QuT52K_!!6000000005100-2-tps-1328-1328.png"},{originImageUrl:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01D1as1J1L65nt2fHdQ_!!6000000001249-2-tps-1328-1328.png",prompt:"Create a stylized 3D chibi character based on the attached photo, faithfully preserving the subject’s distinctive facial features and key clothing details. The character strikes a playful pose—sitting on the edge of a giant Instagram-style frame with both legs dangling outside—and forms a finger heart with their left hand, topped by a glowing red heart icon. The frame’s top edge displays the username “Beauty” in clean, modern typography. Floating around the scene are subtle, semi-transparent social media UI elements: like, comment, and share icons, rendered in a cohesive, non-distracting style. The overall aesthetic is vibrant, cute, and digitally native—blending kawaii chibi charm with contemporary social media visual language.",ratio:"1:1",newImageUrl:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01jODjPc1MpGU6MJ166_!!6000000001483-2-tps-1328-1328.png"}]},learn:[{image:"comment",title:"Explain a confusing topic to me"},{image:"fileMultiplePages",title:"Help me with my homework"},{image:"correctingEssays",title:"Create a practice quiz for me"},{image:"task",title:"Draw up a study plan for me"},{image:"errorNotebook",title:"Analyze the incorrect answer for me"}],t2t:["Create an image of a serene mountain lake.","Create an image of a bustling city skyline.","Create an image of a vibrant flower field.","Create an image of a tranquil forest path.","Create an image of a majestic sunset over ocean.","Create an image of a cozy rustic cabin.","Create an image of a futuristic cityscape at night.","Create an image of a colorful hot air balloon.","Create an image of a peaceful countryside morning.","Create an image of an ancient castle ruins.","Help me create a to-do list app in JavaScript.","Help me build a weather API integration with Python.","Help me design a responsive portfolio site using HTML/CSS.","Help me implement a sorting algorithm in Java.","Help me set up a basic Flask server in Python.","Help me write a script to automate file backups.","Help me with a plan to start a business.","Help me with a plan for saving money.","Help me with a plan to learn a new skill.","Help me with a plan for a healthy lifestyle.","Help me with a plan to organize my home.","Help me with a plan for a successful interview.","Help me with a plan to improve my time management.","Help me with a plan for a family vacation.","Help me with a plan to achieve my goals.","Help me with a plan for a productive day.","Tell me the latest news from New York.","Tell me about today's weather updates.","Tell me what's happening in technology now.","Tell me the top sports headlines today.","Tell me recent developments in climate change.","Tell me about global financial markets today.","Tell me updates on the latest space missions.","Tell me breaking news from around the world.","Tell me health news related to new discoveries.","Create a video of a dog surfing on waves.","Create a video of flowers blooming in fast motion.","Create a video of a chef making pizza art.","Create a video of stars twinkling in the night sky.","Create a video of a robot dancing to jazz.","Create a video of autumn leaves swirling in the wind.","Create a video of a painter creating a mural.","Create a video of dolphins playing with a ball.","Create a video of fireworks lighting up the city.","Create a video of a violinist performing in the rain.","Describe the landscape and its prominent features.","Describe the people and their activities in the image.","Describe the colors and mood of the scene.","Describe the architecture and building materials used.","Describe the interaction between the subjects.","Describe the weather and environmental conditions shown.","Describe the textures and patterns visible.","Describe the lighting and shadows in the image.","Describe the main subject and its surroundings.","Describe the composition and framing of the shot.","Summarize the article on climate change.","Summarize the book's main themes.","Summarize the podcast episode highlights.","Summarize the project's key objectives.","Summarize the lecture on economics.","Summarize the movie plot briefly.","Summarize the report's findings concisely.","Summarize the interview with the expert.","Summarize the research paper's methodology.","Summarize the discussion in the forum.","Give me advice about managing stress.","Give me advice about saving money.","Give me advice about making friends.","Give me advice about staying healthy.","Give me advice about time management.","Give me advice about public speaking.","Give me advice about setting goals.","Give me advice about overcoming fear.","Give me advice about being kind.","Give me advice about finding purpose.","Help me write a poem about autumn leaves.","Help me write an essay on climate change.","Help me write a letter to my future self.","Help me write a story with a twist ending.","Help me write a review of a new book.","Help me write a speech for a graduation ceremony.","Help me write a blog post on mental health.","Help me write a descriptive paragraph about the ocean.","Help me write a character sketch for a novel.","Help me write a persuasive argument for recycling.","Give me an idea for a new eco-friendly product.","Give me an idea to improve mental health support.","Give me an idea for a unique restaurant concept.","Give me an idea to enhance online education tools.","Give me an idea for a sustainable fashion line.","Give me an idea to simplify daily household chores.","Give me an idea for a tech-free entertainment option.","Give me an idea to boost community engagement locally.","Give me an idea for a creative marketing campaign.","Give me an idea to reduce urban traffic congestion.","Create a web page for a personal blog with HTML.","Create a web page showcasing your portfolio with HTML.","Create a web page for a local restaurant with HTML.","Create a web page with a photo gallery using HTML.","Create a web page for a travel guide with HTML.","Create a web page for a simple calculator app with HTML.","Create a web page featuring a quiz game with HTML.","Create a web page for a book club with HTML.","Create a web page for a fitness tracker with HTML.","Create a web page for a weather forecast with HTML."],video:[{src:"https://assets.alicdn.com/g/qwenweb/qwen-chat-fe/0.1.38/static/video/video_squirrel.mp4",description:"A squirrel wearing a little vest is driving a small car made of hazelnut shells for the body and twigs for the wheels, bumping along a leaf-covered forest path."},{src:"https://assets.alicdn.com/g/qwenweb/qwen-chat-fe/0.1.38/static/video/video_couple.mp4",description:"The scene opens with a medium shot of a man and a woman walking side by side across a bridge at sunset. Captured with a handheld camera, the shot features slightly softened depth of field, creating a gentle bokeh effect. The background glows in warm pink-orange hues, softly illuminating their faces, while streetlights emit a gentle glow. They stroll leisurely—the man in a white shirt with a mustard-yellow tie, a brown jacket draped over his arm; the woman in a coral-pink sleeveless dress, holding a beige clutch. A light breeze tousles her hair as the man glances at her: “What do you want to say?” She nods playfully and replies, “You first.” The camera moves steadily alongside them, with subtle handheld sway, cutting between expressive close-ups and wider shots to capture the rhythm of their interaction. The overall visuals feel cinematic and intimate, with realistic lighting, soft motion blur, and fluid, immersive handheld tracking that heighten the natural warmth and authenticity of the moment."},{src:"https://assets.alicdn.com/g/qwenweb/qwen-chat-fe/0.1.38/static/video/video_panda.mp4",description:"The video shows a panda showing off its skills at an urban skate park, riding a skateboard with remarkable agility and executing multiple high-difficulty tricks in succession. The camera closely follows, precisely capturing every flip and spin, showcasing the panda's extreme sports prowess."},{src:"https://assets.alicdn.com/g/qwenweb/qwen-chat-fe/0.1.38/static/video/video_flower.mp4",description:"Using time-lapse photography techniques, the entire process of a flower blooming—from bud to full bloom—is condensed into just a few seconds, accompanied by soothing background music."},{src:"https://assets.alicdn.com/g/qwenweb/qwen-chat-fe/0.1.38/static/video/video_man.mp4",description:'Hard light, side lighting, medium shot, low saturation, high contrast, medium focal length, eye-level close-up of a man. He\'s wearing a striped shirt, sitting at a wooden table with folders and a red telephone on it. His arms are crossed over his chest, and his head rests against the wall. His eyes are closed, mouth slightly open, saying, "I really like it here." A blurred figure appears in the foreground. The background is a dark wooden wall adorned with a painting and other decorations. The entire scene evokes a quiet, contemplative mood.'},{image:"https://qwen-chat.oss-ap-southeast-1.aliyuncs.com/resources/i2v/1762487167.png",src:"https://assets.alicdn.com/g/qwenweb/qwen-chat-fe/0.1.38/static/video/video_deer.mp4",description:"On a lawn in Nara, a girl attentively feeds a fawn, gazing at it, with a Japanese ambiance and bright sunshine."},{image:"https://qwen-chat.oss-ap-southeast-1.aliyuncs.com/resources/i2v/1762076628.png",src:"https://assets.alicdn.com/g/qwenweb/qwen-chat-fe/0.1.38/static/video/video_bear.mp4",description:'The light flickered above his head as he softly asked, "Why does 1 + 1 equal 2?"'},{image:"https://qwen-chat.oss-ap-southeast-1.aliyuncs.com/resources/i2v/1762498392.png",src:"https://assets.alicdn.com/g/qwenweb/qwen-chat-fe/0.1.38/static/video/video_sea.mp4",description:"A diver in a diving suit explores the secrets of a sunken ship in the deep sea, holding a searchlight that illuminates the dark underwater world."}],travel:[{query:"I plan to go to Shanghai alone for three days the day after tomorrow, departing from Hangzhou. Can you help me arrange the itinerary?",title:"Shanghai 3-day cultural tour: an in-depth exploration of museums, gardens, and urban memories"},{query:"Plan a 7-day itinerary for the Northern Xinjiang small loop, departing from Beijing next Monday, for one person",title:"7-Day Self-Drive Tour of Northern Xinjiang's Natural Wonders: A Journey Through Autumn Landscapes"},{query:"Next weekend, the three of us in my family will depart from Shanghai and head to Qiandao Lake for a two-day trip. Please arrange an itinerary for us.",title:"Qiandao Lake family slow tour: a two-day lakeside and mountain scenery trip from Shanghai on September 20-21, 2025"},{query:"Next Saturday, my family of three will leave from Beijing to Nanjing for a three-day trip. Please arrange the itinerary for me.",title:"3-Day Relaxing Family Trip to Nanjing: A Journey of Cultural Strolls and Natural Adventures"}],deepResearch:[{query:"Using Ne Zha 2 as an entry point to analyze the development of Chinese cinema",title:"Ne Zha 2: A milestone in the industrialization and cultural export of Chinese cinema"},{query:"Please introduce and compare the advantages and disadvantages of the three algorithms PPO, GRPO, and DAPO respectively",title:"Comparative analysis of the advantages and disadvantages of PPO, GRPO, and DAPO algorithms"},{query:"I want to go to Hong Kong for a week. Can you help me plan the itinerary, departing from Beijing?",title:"Research Report on a One-Week Travel Itinerary from Beijing to Hong Kong"},{query:"Research the 5 vitamins most needed by Chinese people, describing their functions, the scientific research behind them, the principles of how they work in the body, and methods and recommendations for supplementing vitamins for the general public.",title:"The 5 Most Essential Vitamins for Chinese People: Their Functions and Supplementation Recommendations"},{query:"Analysis and prediction of the men's singles professional tennis landscape in the next three years",title:"Research Report on the Development Trends of Men's Professional Singles Tennis over the Next Three Years"}],webdev:[{darkSrc:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN017XBwc120EhQlYC19P_!!6000000006818-2-tps-948-543.png",src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01xlhSky1GuPAf4eFrK_!!6000000000682-2-tps-948-543.png",title:"Create a personal website for a software engineer, including sections such as personal introduction, education background, project experience, etc."},{darkSrc:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN012BqDoa1Pa69W0BdH8_!!6000000001856-2-tps-948-543.png",src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN011dEWtw1rpx6TbxdQj_!!6000000005681-2-tps-948-543.png",title:'Create a semantic "Contact Support" form with fields for the user\'s name, email, issue type, and message. Arrange the form elements vertically within a card.'},{darkSrc:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01Ytn7DF1CaTTG0gSei_!!6000000000097-2-tps-948-543.png",src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01iVUvAq1i3YiGagDmD_!!6000000004357-2-tps-948-543.png",title:"Write a fruit e-commerce website."},{darkSrc:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01ihIvuO1yioEnAH8u1_!!6000000006613-2-tps-948-543.png",src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01ywIpzR1Xgz24H0Ncl_!!6000000002954-2-tps-948-543.png",title:'How many "r"s are in the word "strawberrrrry"? Make a cute little card!'},{darkSrc:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01uhXGeZ1ZKexWGzZlM_!!6000000003176-2-tps-948-543.png",src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01PIcmRB1PEZXN1OKaN_!!6000000001809-2-tps-948-543.png",title:"Create a social networking website with a RedNote-style design."},{darkSrc:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01kArlys1wCAma0newZ_!!6000000006271-2-tps-948-543.png",src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01s5jfll1uOsXTRizNd_!!6000000006028-2-tps-948-543.png",title:"Create a sunscreen product introduction website."}],artifacts:[{darkSrc:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01ZdJIjT1fF3sUKjTNr_!!6000000003976-2-tps-428-428.png",src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01AgbiQ71yFUxO3h4xH_!!6000000006549-2-tps-428-428.png",title:"Make a Snake game"},{darkSrc:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01S9mOFg1evMqfRtvET_!!6000000003933-2-tps-428-428.png",src:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN017K0DcV1POBvESFfa3_!!6000000001830-2-tps-428-428.png",title:"Make a small Gomoku game."},{darkSrc:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01I5THsV1qZdRbRF9iD_!!6000000005510-2-tps-428-428.png",src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01a6ENqb1r0CPqXgVxK_!!6000000005568-2-tps-428-428.png",title:"Make a Minesweeper mini-game."},{darkSrc:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01wn4g301Bzpr3kSh1k_!!6000000000017-2-tps-428-428.png",src:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01d56W5Z1OHwuMXAODJ_!!6000000001681-2-tps-428-428.png",title:'How many "r" in strawberry? Make a cute card.'},{darkSrc:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01667lYe1Vmoumn8WcH_!!6000000002696-2-tps-428-428.png",src:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01xtY5q81p0559MmbeU_!!6000000005297-2-tps-428-428.png",title:"Create a simple calculator web application"},{darkSrc:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01Ep3Zzc1utZ8uDdQgj_!!6000000006095-2-tps-428-428.png",src:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01uv8VjV1KmOmEpjYIP_!!6000000001206-2-tps-428-428.png",title:"Create a personal portfolio website with sections for an 'About Me' page, a 'Projects' gallery, a 'Blog' for sharing articles, and a 'Contact' form."},{darkSrc:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01wyU3f627u6c9sX6S6_!!6000000007856-2-tps-428-428.png",src:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01ZeTokW1jyBMTnpBRD_!!6000000004616-2-tps-428-428.png",title:"Create a graphical workflow overview HTML of RAGs"},{darkSrc:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01c9hWwo1CNC3KoT7tt_!!6000000000068-2-tps-428-428.png",src:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01naKo021scxY6NHkBf_!!6000000005788-2-tps-428-428.png",title:"Create a presentation deck for a startup pitch, including slides for the company overview, market analysis, product features, business model, and financial projections. The presentation should be visually appealing, and have multiple slides that user can switch to next and previous slides by clicking the arrow keys."},{darkSrc:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01gDjcpE25kMxmi0uFY_!!6000000007564-2-tps-428-428.png",src:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01CY0TRf1k00wg7XDr1_!!6000000004620-2-tps-428-428.png",title:"Check the weather in London and make a weather card including temperature, weather, and emoji expressions."}]},Eb={thumbSrcArr:[{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN017XBwc120EhQlYC19P_!!6000000006818-2-tps-948-543.png",thumbSrc:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01oCnNjp1xBXvmYeKEG_!!6000000006405-49-tps-400-229.webp"},{src:"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01ZdJIjT1fF3sUKjTNr_!!6000000003976-2-tps-428-428.png",thumbSrc:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01pi0Uyx1JVAGWmnXeG_!!6000000001033-49-tps-400-400.webp"},{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01Zz1Vkw1wqThW3tPiv_!!6000000006359-2-tps-1328-1328.png",thumbSrc:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01wOjTM81VeZnHjc1qq_!!6000000002678-49-tps-400-400.webp"},{src:"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01D1as1J1L65nt2fHdQ_!!6000000001249-2-tps-1328-1328.png",thumbSrc: